// The carve-out GH #774 must not run over: a POLICY seed. It closes
// no world — no `main locus` — so its constitution is adopted
// somewhere else, and spec `verification.md` ("Groups are not
// implied") makes `guests` the ADOPTING entrypoint's to declare. The
// reference stays open through the import on purpose.
constitution House {
    guests_sign_nothing: forbid reaches(guests, effects(secret_use));
}
